  "details": "Jivejdon from commit d58a36b0 through commit ee67a65e contains a missing authorization vulnerability in UpdateThreadToForumAction that allows authenticated users to move other users' threads. Attackers can send crafted threadId and forumId values to /message/threadToForum/save to relocate any reply-less thread into an arbitrary forum.",
